sequenceDiagram
 participant C as pg_cron / each minute
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant N as pg_net + Vault
 participant J as jobs function
 participant S as Spotify or Storage
 C->>D: scheduler_tick / inspect due work
 D->>N: Dispatch when needed with cron secret
 N->>J: POST jobs
 J->>D: Record SHA, claim due job with 100s lease
 D-->>J: Job + lease token + epoch
 J->>D: Validate or renew fence
 J->>S: Bounded remote action
 J->>D: Persist checkpoint
 alt work completed
 J->>D: Finish done if lease still valid
 else budget or retry
 J->>D: Queue with retry_at
 else function killed
 Note over D,J: Lease expires, later invocation claims work
 end